The collaboration between WalletConnect and Base offers several advantages:Improved User Experience: WalletConnect simplifies the process of connecting to Base dApps, making Web3 more accessible to non-technical users.
Enhanced Security: End-to-end encryption ensures that transactions on Base are secure, with private keys never leaving the user’s wallet.
Scalability for Developers: Developers building on Base can integrate WalletConnect’s SDKs to enable wallet connectivity, supporting a wide range of wallets and attracting a broader user base.
Cross-Chain Flexibility: Users can interact with Base and other blockchains simultaneously, fostering a more interconnected Web3 ecosystem.

